---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Broadmeadow Brewery"
  description="About Broadmeadow Brewery, our 21L all-grain setup, and brewing philosophy."
>
  <div class="outer page-wrap">
    <div class="canvas prose">
      <h1>About Broadmeadow Brewery</h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>Broadmeadow Brewery</strong>—a personal homebrewing journal documenting brewday writeups, iterative recipe developments, split-batch experiments, and competition results.
      </p>

      <h2>The Brewhouse</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Batch Volume:</strong> 21.0 L (5.5 US Gal) all-grain electric HERMS system</li>
        <li><strong>Milling:</strong> Two-roller mill set to a <code>0.95 mm</code> gap with malt conditioning</li>
        <li><strong>Water Treatment:</strong> Reverse-osmosis blank slate mineralized with precision salt additions for each style</li>
        <li><strong>Fermentation &amp; Cellar:</strong> Temperature-controlled stainless conicals, pressure spunding, and a 3-tap keezer with a Czech LUKR side-pull faucet</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Adding a New Post</h2>
      <p>
        Every writeup lives as a simple Markdown file in <code>src/content/posts/</code>. Include a <code>recipe</code> block in the frontmatter to automatically render the recipe specification and Malt Bill table with grist percentages.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-wrap {
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .page-wrap h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-wrap {
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
